ply
format ascii 1.0
comment AssimpForUnreal test fixture: axis-aligned cube spanning -1..1 on every axis.
comment Every face is wound counter-clockwise when viewed from outside, so in the
comment source's right-handed space each face normal points away from the origin.
element vertex 8
property float x
property float y
property float z
element face 12
property list uchar int vertex_index
end_header
